 r←Test_Input_Misc_022(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms
⍝ Exercise "Input" with no buttons at all
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Name' 'Enter your name:' ''DT.Character

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.cancelBtnCaption←''
 parms.okBtnCaption←''
 parms.testMode←1
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬

 n.Name ∆KeyPress'Kai Jaeger'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴'Button'⎕WN n.∆Form

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
